      "Executive summary": "Day 1 has produced eight immutable exploratory experiment blocks, one fresh CEF-10 checkpoint-training block, and a tested, restartable two-agent stack. A direct-reward v3 control learned material energy transfer on 64 held-out worlds in each of three training seeds, but this remains engineered behavior rather than emergence: the policies manufactured 5--8 times more need opportunities, cycled energy bidirectionally, and shortened sampled episodes in every seed. No JEPA condition has run and every emergence score remains unscored. The last source-bound suite before phase-3/4 integration passed `326/326`; a new full receipt is pending. Partial resume is provenance-locked, interrupts and unsupported jobs fail closed, and semantic progress publication is nonblocking and retryable. The old schedule record remains nonexecuting and cannot open `FALSIFY-v1.1`; execution authority instead flows through the separately validated CEF parent DAG and typed adapter. CEF-01..09 are complete (`9/9`) at replacement CEF-09 freeze `49424c7b31a01f04e0ecf89dbee5d9849bd4845305d629556bb6d4ecd910170b`. The accepted firewall reconstructs internal parent edges and exact content contracts, then derives three typed views only after one committed opaque read. CEF-10 has executed factual enumeration and screen-domain-only neutral screening, then selected 485 windows without reading estimation outcomes. The schedule remains unanchored; estimation, do-minus-i, final gate evaluation, and JEPA remain locked. This is evaluator engineering progress, not causal or emergence evidence. The JEPA matrix remains pending and unclaimed.",
